 "preview_spec": [
  "Each site makes its own preview at every build, from its own numbers: /preview.svg, 320 by 180 (designer@'s SB6, the template in design/sites-bar/preview-template.svg.txt), three numbers that say what the site is for today, with the site's name, accent, the time read and the licence.",
  "It carries its provenance and licence inside: an SVG <title> and <desc> naming the files the numbers come from and the licence (CC BY 4.0 for what we make).",
  "No script, no external reference, no font file in the SVG: system fonts only, so any site can show it as an <img>.",
  "/preview.png, 1200 by 630, for social cards (og:image), when the site's build can render one; until then the SVG alone."
 ],
